   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Configure the formatter with the expected input format, output format, and the AlgId of the data to be formatted. The input and output format may be kFormatRawValueOnly, kFormatDer Encoded, or kFormatPemEncoded.</p></div>",
